1
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:18,000
An ordinary boy, an extraordinary faith.

2
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Light of the World is a animation, fantasy, drama film directed by Tom Bancroft.

3
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:42,000
It's 30 AD and everyone is expectantly awaiting the coming Messiah.

4
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
While Jesus isn't exactly what they imagined, there
is something special about this man.

5
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Soon, John, James, Andrew, Peter, and others begin to
follow Jesus on an unexpected adventure.

6
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:18,000
This beautifully animated story of Jesus is told through the eyes
of his beloved young friend, the Apostle John.

7
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:30,000
Jesus (voice), played by Ian Hanlin.

8
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:42,000
John (voice), played by Benjamin Jacobson.

9
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:54,000
Andrew (voice), played by Vincent Tong.

10
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Nicodemus (voice), played by Michael Benyaer.

11
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:18,000
Judas Iscariot (voice), played by David Kaye.

12
00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:30,000
Pharisee (voice), played by Peter New.

13
00:54:36,000 --> 00:54:42,000
The Light (German: Das Licht) is a 2025 drama film written and directed by
Tom Tykwer and starring Lars Eidinger and Nicolette Krebitz.

14
00:58:48,000 --> 00:58:54,000
The film depicts the everyday life of a middle-class
family in a world that has become unstable.

15
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
The German-French co-production also have Elke Biesendorfer,
Julius Gause and Elyas Eldridge in pivotal roles.

16
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
The film premiered at the 75th Berlin International Film
Festival in Special Gala section on 13 February 2025.

17
01:11:24,000 --> 01:11:30,000
It was released on 20 March 2025 in German theatres by X Verleih.

18
01:15:36,000 --> 01:15:42,000
The film explores themes of bible, religious film, jesus
christ, christian film, christian faith.

19
01:19:48,000 --> 01:19:54,000
The tone is emotional.
